return {
    ["      “这份尸检报告相当完美，尤其是示意图的绘制……弗莱，听说你曾经想成为一位画家?”层层叠叠的卷宗后，戴莉微笑着抬头，看向面前青年沉默而苍白的面容。\n\n      “是的，戴莉女士。”弗莱略带意外地回答：“这的确对现在的工作有一定帮助。”\n      “在听说你会被调去贝克兰德后，弗莱就一直在学习，直到能顺利接手这部分事务。”房门被推开，邓恩握着一份文件走了进来。\n      他看向二人的目光深邃而温和：“你可以放心了，戴莉——以及，你的正式调令到了。”\n\n      文件在苦涩的咖啡香气中展开，戴莉将它接过，目光却在邓恩和弗莱身上来回流转，直到露出一个不带任何轻佻的微笑。\n      “我一直都很放心，毕竟在我之前和在我之后，都有那么可靠的守护者。”"] = "      \"This autopsy report is quite perfect, especially the drawing of the schematic... Frye, I heard you once wanted to be a painter?\" Behind layers of files, Daly looked up with a smile at the silent, pale face of the young man before her.\n\n      \"Yes, Ms. Daly.\" Frye answered with slight surprise: \"It does indeed help with my current work to some extent.\"\n      \"Ever since he heard he would be transferred to Backlund, Frye has been studying until he could smoothly take over this part of the affairs.\" The door was pushed open, and Dunn walked in holding a document.\n      His gaze toward the two was deep and gentle: \"You can rest easy, Daly—and, your official transfer order has arrived.\"\n\n      The document was unfolded amidst the bitter aroma of coffee. Daly took it, but her gaze wandered between Dunn and Frye until she revealed a smile without any hint of frivolity.\n      \"I have always been at ease, after all, both before me and after me, there have been such reliable Guardians.\"",
