    ["<DecH>工艺：</>暗纹绒缎・秘银鳞甲・干练军装\n银纹织就的誓言在肩头沉淀，铁与布在风中低语，像某种无声的律令。"] = "<DecH>Craftsmanship: </>Dark Patterned Velvet · Mithril Scale Armor · Professional Military Uniform\nThe oath woven in silver patterns settles on the shoulders; iron and cloth whisper in the wind, like some silent decree.",
    ["<Highlight>没做完占坑</>，参与副本<Highlight>罗塞尔大帝（英雄）</>，有概率获得下列外观。"] = "<Highlight>Placeholder for incomplete content</>, participate in the dungeon <Highlight>Emperor Roselle (Hero)</>, there is a chance to obtain the following appearances.",
    ["<P_Heart>（才没有说想回家……不过看来成功混过去了。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(I didn't say I wanted to go home... but it seems I successfully bluffed my way through.)</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：这个世界，嘻嘻~总有人比你更绝情！"] = "<P_Yellow>Clown</>: In this world, hehe~ there is always someone more heartless than you!",
    ["<Yellow>黑面草之地</>：使携带者进入濒临诅咒状态，持续5分钟后，转化为<Yellow>背负诅咒</>状态。该状态下死亡时，会在原地长出一片半径8米的活化土地，持续10秒，对范围内的最多10名友方玩家施加下述效果：\n每秒恢复携带者生命值上限<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</>的生命值，优先选择剩余生命值较低的友方，超过5人则治疗量衰减；\n获得攻击提升效果，提升值为携带者攻击的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</>，最多对10人生效；\n免除<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</>人次控制效果。\n效果触发后，或者切换场景时，濒临诅咒重新开始生效。"] = "<Yellow>Land of Black-Faced Grass</>: Causes the carrier to enter a near-cursed state, which transforms into the <Yellow>Bearing the Curse</> state after 5 minutes. When dying in this state, an activated land with a radius of 8 meters will grow on the spot, lasting 10 seconds, applying the following effects to up to 10 friendly players in the range: \nRestores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</> of the carrier's maximum Health per second, prioritizing friendly units with lower remaining Health; if there are more than 5 people, the healing amount is reduced; \nGains an Attack Boost effect, with the increase value being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</> of the carrier's Attack, effective for up to 10 people; \nExempts <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</> instances of control effects. \nAfter the effect is triggered, or when switching scenes, the near-cursed state begins to take effect again.",
