    ["“头狼”鲁珀"] = "Luper, the Alpha Wolf",
    ["“我会回忆起那些我们携手探寻过的梦境，回忆起曾困扰我们的每一个非凡案件或封印物，回忆起风吹的方向，还有月亮的形状和颜色。”"] = "\"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\"",
    ["“收尸人”途径能够驱使亡灵，看起来又神秘又酷炫，但我有些害怕尸体……"] = "The \"Corpse Collector\" pathway can drive the undead, which sounds mysterious and cool, but I'm a bit afraid of corpses...",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>一天，戴莉发现邓恩从地上捡起来什么东西，固定在角上后它发现是自己掉落的羽毛。</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>“这些羽毛太美了，我舍不得它们就这样被遗忘。”邓恩甩了甩头，“即使我明天就会忘记为什么要这么做，但我的角会记得这种发痒的感觉。”</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>戴莉的心轻轻颤动，她激动地盘旋在邓恩的两角之间，准备一展歌喉抖落几根崭新的羽毛。邓恩阻止了它这种会让自己更冷的行为，请它帮忙整理那些收集好的羽毛。戴莉将它们和一个个木牌挂在一起，让它们在风雪中碰撞，与鹿蹄声和鸟鸣声组成森林的曲调。</>"] = "　　<InvDefault_HW>One day, Daly discovered that Dunn had picked something up from the ground and fixed it to its antlers; it realized it was one of its own fallen feathers.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>\"These feathers are too beautiful; I can't bear for them to be forgotten just like that.\" Dunn shook its head, \"Even if I forget why I did this tomorrow, my antlers will remember this itching sensation.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Daly's heart trembled gently. She fluttered excitedly between Dunn's two antlers, preparing to show off her voice and shake off a few brand-new feathers. Dunn stopped her from doing something that would make her even colder and asked her to help organize the collected feathers. Daly hung them together with the wooden plaques, letting them collide in the wind and snow, composing the forest's melody along with the sound of deer hooves and birdsong.</>",
